# env.optional — enrichment only; the skill runs fully (keyless) without these.
#
# Measured-metric enrichment via the bundled scripts/paid_seo.py adapter (DataForSEO,
# HTTP Basic auth). When set, it returns real volume/difficulty/authority/backlinks and
# the directional labels upgrade to "measured"; absent -> SERP-derived rank/indexation,
# and the backlink profile (no free fallback) stays "requires paid API":
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
# Alternative paid providers (NOT implemented in paid_seo.py; out-of-band only):
KEYWORD_ANALYSIS_API_KEY
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_TOKEN
# Hostile-site sitemap-crawl fallback (absent -> serp + sitemap crawl):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
